-- cpl_memory decision rows for SkyLinnet (S688): #3560 part 2, the Library's accessibility check run, list on a pass,
-- the footer from the check record, and the tab's url-aware pre-check (COBIx on #3560, comment 7025524965). The
-- conductor's decisions, reversible. INSERT ... ON CONFLICT (slug) DO NOTHING; the rows land proposed. Apply after
-- kb/migrations/2026-11-20_library_check_after_page_change.sql.
-- d-library-check-after-page-change-s688 changes the version branch of d-library-new-page-unlists-s687 (a machine row,
